<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Florium Flower Shop</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
    background:linear-gradient(to right,#d44f66,#e883b8);
}

/* TOP BAR */

.topbar{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    padding:15px 40px;
    background:#f3bbe4;
}

.logo{
    font-weight:bold;
}

.cart{
    background:black; 
    color:white;
    padding:10px 20px;
}

/* CONTACT SECTION */

.contact-section{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    padding:20px 40px;
}

.brand{
    font-size:40px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

/* NAVBAR */

.navbar{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    gap:35px;
    padding:20px;
    border-top:1px solid #eee;
    border-bottom:1px solid #eee;
}

.navbar a{
    text-decoration:none;
    color:black;
    font-weight:500;
}

/* HERO SECTION */

.hero{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    padding:60px;
}

.hero-text{
    width:50%;
}

.hero-text h1{
    font-size:70px;
    margin:10px 0;
}

.hero-text p{
    line-height:30px;
}

.btn{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:20px;
    padding:15px 30px;
    background:pink;
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-weight:bold;
    border:none;
    cursor:pointer;
    border-radius:5px;
}

.hero-image{
    width:35%;
    text-align:center;
    animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.hero-image img{
    width: 80%;
    max-width:300px;
    border-radius:10px;
    transition: 0.4s;
}

.hero-image img:hover{
    transform: scale(1.08) rotate(2deg);
    box-shadow: 0px 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}

@keyframes float{
    0%{ transform: translateY(0px); }
    50%{ transform: translateY(-15px); }
    100%{ transform: translateY(0px); }
}

/* FORM SECTION */

.form-page{
    display:none;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    height:100vh;
}

.form-container{
    background:white;
    width:350px;
    padding:40px;
    border-radius:10px;
    box-shadow:0px 0px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
}

.form-container h2{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:25px;
}

.form-container input{
    width:100%;
    padding:14px;
    margin-bottom:15px;
    border:1px solid #ccc;
    border-radius:5px;
    font-size:15px;
}

.form-container button{
    width:100%;
    padding:14px;
    border:none;
    background:pink;
    color:white;
    font-size:16px;
    font-weight:bold;
    cursor:pointer;
    border-radius:5px;
}

.form-container p{
    text-align:center;
    margin-top:15px;
}

.form-container a{
    color:#d44f66;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-weight:bold;
}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<!-- TOP BAR -->

<div class="topbar">

    <div class="logo">
        Florium - Flower Store Website
    </div>

    <div>
        🖥
    </div>

    <div class="cart">
        Add to Cart
    </div>

</div>



<div class="contact-section">

    <div>
        <b>Call us: +1 (844) 123 456 789</b><br><br>
        info@demolink.org
    </div>

    <div class="brand">
        Florium
    </div>

    <div></div>

</div>

<!-- NAVBAR -->

<div class="navbar">

    <a href="#">HOME</a>
    <a href="#">PAGES</a>
    <a href="#">BLOG</a>
    <a href="#">GALLERY</a>
    <a href="#">ELEMENTS</a>
    <a href="shop.html">SHOP</a>

</div>

<!-- HOME PAGE -->

<div class="hero" id="homePage">

    <div class="hero-text">

        <h3>WELCOME TO #1 FLOWER SHOP</h3>

        <h1>FLORIUM</h1>

        <p>

            At Florium, we don’t just create beautiful flower bouquets — we craft thoughtful bouquets for every occasion and every emotion.<br><br>

            Along with fresh floral arrangements, we also offer unique bouquet collections including chocolates, makeup products, teddy bears, perfumes, gifts, and customized surprise hampers.<br><br>

            Whether it’s a birthday, anniversary, celebration, or a special moment, our creative bouquets are designed to make every occasion memorable and full of happiness.<br><br>

            We believe every bouquet should tell a story, spread joy, and make your loved ones feel truly special.

        </p>

        <button class="btn" onclick="showSignup()">
            SHOP NOW
        </button>

    </div>

    <div class="hero-image">

        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"" alt="Flower Bouquet">

    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
